    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "Universal Item is implemented behind its Settings toggle. Look Right now uses FF8's configured action mapping, applies the native Item-disabled gate, and enters the native Item availability/dispatch path without adding a sixth command slot. Disabled mode emits no hook and keeps vanilla input handling. Scan remains actionable while its safe target-to-Scan-screen transition is traced; the known effect path would execute Scan and consume battle state, so it is not used as a shortcut.",
